('200001','0','0','Y','2021-05-30 14:45:33','100','2021-05-30 14:45:33','100','MFA Validation Code','Y','MFA Validation Code for iDempiere','<p>Hello @Name@,</p>'||char(10)||char(10)||'<p>The validation code for multi-factor authentication on iDempiere is: <b>@MFASecret@</b></p>'||char(10)||char(10)||'<p>This validation code expires in @MFA_Method_ID<ExpireInMinutes>@ minutes.</p>',NULL,NULL,'e49493ce-1e00-4d65-a537-bc962e419bbc');
